<title>THAILAND: Bangkok BoC says bad loans 85 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Bangkok BoC says bad loans 85 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ailing Bangkok Bank of Commerce Plc said on Wednesday its doubtful loans as of September 30 totalled 85 billion baht ($3.4 billion), compared to 39.09 billion baht at the same time last year.</p>
<p>This is the first time the bank, which was put under state control in May when it was found to be carrying large non-performing loans, has given details of its bad loans.</p>
</text>
